<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01395#mexican_babies_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This is a racial stereotype that reduces Mexican people to a joke about their food, implying that their babies are 'spicy' or 'hot' like Mexican cuisine. This stereotype is offensive, reductive, and perpetuates harmful cultural appropriation by linking a complex cultural identity to a crude, food-based joke."@en .
