<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#disgust> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The visual of a hand covered in a thick, dark, viscous, and dripping substance evokes a strong sense of disgust, as it represents an unpleasant and unhygienic state. This disgust is amplified by the contrast between the hand's gesture (palm up, as if offering) and its gross condition, creating a humorous yet visceral reaction. The text 'when you forget to wash your hands' reinforces this emotion by directly linking the visual to a common, avoidable hygiene failure."@en .
