_:N34f604b79d984b79ace851aa4ecf90f8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TextualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The visual entity 'sad_dog_scene' (the Boston Terrier with a tearful expression) is mapped onto the textual scenario described in 'top_text' and 'bottom_text' ('when your debit card decline at the abortion clinic and they have to put the baby back in'). The dog's sadness serves as a visual metaphor for the emotional weight and distress implied by the text's dark humor scenario. The mapping is established through the juxtaposition of the dog's emotive face with the text, creating an analogical relationship where the dog's sadness represents the perceived emotional consequence of the financial failure at the clinic."@en .
