<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01459#overgeneralization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme satirizes the fallacy of overgeneralization by claiming 'they're re all terrorists' (presumably referring to all spiders). Understanding this logical concept is necessary to appreciate the meme's critique of labeling entire groups as inherently evil or dangerous."@en .
_:N7ee5114ca54d460fbcb0c57d990166ba <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N0dba42aa9bf84c4a96bdc06ebc0dc209 .
