<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01264#pun_on_nuts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on the double meaning of the word 'nuts' — referring to the animal (squirrel) that stores nuts, and the colloquial term for someone who is crazy or eccentric. This wordplay is a common form of humor in English and requires understanding of idiomatic language to appreciate the joke."@en .
