<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01359#let_me_in> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A phrase commonly used to express a desire to enter a restricted or private space. In the context of the meme, it is used humorously to depict the 'Naruto Runners' pleading to gain access to Area 51, with the final image of the gate symbolizing the barrier they are trying to breach. This phrase is a common trope in comedy and satire, often used to exaggerate the desperation or absurdity of a situation."@en .
