<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01324#historical_criminal_event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept of a 'historical criminal event' refers to a significant crime that occurred in the past and has become part of public memory or folklore. In this case, the Great Train Robbery is such an event. The meme relies on the public's awareness of this specific historical event to create its humorous effect. Without knowledge of this event, the juxtaposition of the text with the image would lack its intended comedic or ironic impact."@en .
