<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01526#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with retail checkout scenarios and modern consumer culture. The humor relies on the universal understanding of a cashier's role, the absurdity of charging for a mundane action, and the use of a payment terminal in a retail setting. No specific demographic, cultural, or community markers are present that would target a niche group; the joke is accessible to anyone who has experienced or observed a retail transaction."@en .
