<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#childhood_innocence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The widely recognized cultural concept that children are inherently innocent, pure, and non-violent. This concept is central to the meme's irony — the juxtaposition of children in a context of violence (bomb vests) with the text about a 'nativity play' (a symbol of innocence and celebration) creates a jarring and potentially harmful contrast."@en .
