<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#Democratic_Party_United_States> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One of the two major political parties in the United States, often associated with progressive policies on immigration, social justice, and civil rights. The meme references this party's alleged position on DACA, which requires understanding of U.S. political ideology and party platforms."@en .
