<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#incredulity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "expression of disbelief"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#comparativelyPositionedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:Ne99bc040ff6b45059eaf5247bcb262b5 .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#self_perception_vs_others_view> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The scene depicts a man with a stern expression, representing how he might perceive himself ('how you guys think you looks like'), juxtaposed with the implied perception of 'pados wale pandit jee' ('but when pados wale pandit jee sees you'), creating a contrast between self-image and external judgment. The man is the central visual entity, and the text overlays define the contrasting perspectives."@en .
