<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the text overlay 'and that was the last nativity play my son was invited to take part in', which uses 'my son' to create a personal, first-person connection. This implies the user is identifying with the parent whose child was involved in the event, making the user feel personally implicated or affected by the situation described. The projection is onto the textual material, which anchors the user's perspective to the narrative of the nativity play being a 'bomb' or dangerous event."@en .
_:N036f61d51da24a9ea76271a4f06645fb <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:Ne56a4c70f2ba48988a531f1dfb957966 .
