<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01392#happiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The girl is displaying a broad, genuine smile with visible teeth, bright eyes, and an upward curve of the lips, indicating a state of joy and contentment. Her facial expression conveys innocence and delight, suggesting she is happily engaged in the phone conversation."@en .
