<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01389#brunch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Brunch is a meal that combines breakfast and lunch, typically eaten in the late morning or early afternoon. It is a social and leisurely activity often associated with weekends and relaxation. The mention of 'brunch time' sets a casual, relaxed context for the activity described in the meme."@en .
