<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01349#affectionate_interaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scene depicting Adolf_Hitler leaning down towards a young girl in a seemingly affectionate pose, with overlaid text suggesting a nurturing or praising interaction. The spatial arrangement places Hitler on the left, leaning over the child who is positioned on the right, creating an intimate, close-proximity interaction. The text overlays ('girl you're so special', 'i'm gonna give you a gold star') create a jarring contrast with the historical context, implying a false or sanitized narrative of Hitler's character."@en .
