<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01325#World_Cup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The FIFA World Cup is the most prestigious international soccer tournament, held every four years, where national teams compete for the title of world champion. The meme references this global event, implying the intense emotional response of fans when their national team scores a goal during this high-stakes competition."@en .
