<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01483#stereotype_of_muslims_as_bored> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme implicitly references a stereotype that Muslims, particularly in certain contexts or portrayals, are shown as passive, uninterested, or unengaged. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is activated by the visual of the bored man in a mosque and the text. The humor is derived from this stereotype being presented as a reason to go to a mosque, which is a place of active spiritual practice."@en .
