<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#racist_joke_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A meme format that uses a juxtaposition of a historical figure associated with extreme racism (like Hitler) with a text that makes a logically absurd or ironic statement about racism, often to provoke thought or humor. The scene relies on the viewer's knowledge of the historical figure's atrocities to understand the satirical or critical intent."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01487#assertion_about_01487> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityType> "Abusive"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01329#assertion_about_01329> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme uses vulgar and confrontational language ('saddle up motherfuckers') to create a sense of aggression and shock, which can be perceived as abusive due to its crude tone and potential to provoke discomfort or offense."@en .
