_:Nc70dfe5aa5bb444caeac17cebf8ed2c7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01382#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'my body my choice' is overlaid on the image and juxtaposed with the visual of a hand erasing the word 'Abortion'. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual assertion of personal autonomy and choice is visually represented by the act of erasing the word 'Abortion', implying that the concept of abortion is being removed or rejected. This mapping is paradoxical, as the text supports abortion rights while the visual action opposes it, creating a provocative contrast."@en .
