<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#personal_hygiene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept of washing hands is a fundamental aspect of personal hygiene and public health, widely taught and practiced globally. It is a basic health practice to prevent the spread of germs and diseases. The meme relies on the viewer's understanding of this universal concept to make the visual metaphor humorous and relatable."@en .
