<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#situationallyIronicalTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates one dimension describing a situation that contradicts expectations set by another dimension in memes"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#cultural_differences> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#extractionMethod> "llm_extraction_huggingface" .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The top text 'they see them rollin.....' is an analogical mapping that projects the visual entity 'Nazi_leaders_in_car' (specifically Hitler and Goebbels in the parade) onto the textual concept of 'they' (the leaders) who are 'seeing' or 'rolling' (implying a sense of power, movement, and perhaps obliviousness to consequences). This mapping uses the text to characterize the visual subjects as powerful, in control, and perhaps indifferent to the suffering shown below."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#perspectivallyContradicting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
