<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01465#harmful_context_protest_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The scene depicted in the image is a protest or demonstration, which is used to imply that the individuals in the image are engaged in violent or terrorist activities. This is a common tactic in hate speech and propaganda to associate Muslims with violence and terrorism, even though the individuals in the image are not actual terrorists."@en .
