<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#comedy_through_exaggeration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The humor in the meme stems from the extreme exaggeration of a mundane situation — a hand covered in oil or grease — to represent the consequences of forgetting to wash hands. This comedic technique relies on the viewer's understanding of how absurdly exaggerated the situation is compared to reality, which is a common trope in internet memes."@en .
