<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01465#hijab_niqab_as_qua_entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The niqab worn by the individuals in the image is used as a qua-entity to represent 'Muslims' in a stereotypical and potentially dehumanizing way. This visual marker is used to group all individuals wearing it under a single, reductive identity, ignoring individual diversity and context. This is a common tactic in hate speech and propaganda to create a monolithic 'other'."@en .
