<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01467#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses the juxtaposition of a positive, celebratory visual (happy man, thumbs up) with a racially charged, offensive term to create a harmful and hateful message. The intent is to demean and dehumanize white people by associating them with a pejorative label, which constitutes hateful content under the specified toxicity categories."@en .
