<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01476#body_positivity_movement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A social and cultural movement promoting self-acceptance and confidence regardless of physical appearance, body type, or disability. This movement challenges traditional beauty standards and encourages individuals to embrace their unique physicality. The meme leverages this concept to celebrate self-confidence in the context of physical difference, specifically prosthetic use."@en .
