<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#Moral_Accountability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept that individuals or groups are responsible for the consequences of their actions, including historical actions. The meme uses this concept to frame a rhetorical contrast between contemporary immigration policy and historical responsibility, requiring understanding of moral philosophy and political discourse."@en .
