<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01359#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the textual plea 'let me iiiiiiiiiiiin!' and 'let me in', which are central to the meme's narrative. The user identifies with the desperate, humorous attempt to gain entry, as if they are the 'Naruto Runners' pleading to enter Area 51. This projection is reinforced by the visual progression from yelling in the desert to the gate, symbolizing the user's own imagined or humorous desire to breach a barrier."@en .
