<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#mapping_id_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'meanwhile at the isis strip club' maps the visual entity 'men_in_traditional_head_coverings' as the patrons of the strip club. Their exaggerated shock expressions are used to imply they are reacting to the 'performance' (the sheep), reinforcing the stereotype that men in traditional attire are sexually aroused or inappropriate in public spaces."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#SelectiveMasking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Strategic placement of text to selectively hide or reveal specific content in memes"@en .
_:N7ce35701127347b68196b258161f47fb <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person depicted is mapped as the 'goat' (a romantic partner) who has been caught with another man, based on the text overlay. The visual of them concealing a handgun suggests they are the subject of the retaliation, implying the audience is viewing this from the perspective of the betrayed partner."@en .
_:N99a8f22e6afe4698b348f0f934331a96 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> .
