<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01487#holding_sign_at_event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman is holding a white sign with text at a Howard Stern Sirius Radio event. The sign includes the date '1-9-06' and the event name. The woman is wearing glasses and a pink jacket over a purple shirt. The background features a branded backdrop with logos and raised fists. The scene is framed to focus on the woman and the sign she is holding, with the overlaid meme text 'when you forget you're retarded' adding context to the image's intent."@en .
