<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#nazi_leaders_parade> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Top panel shows Adolf Hitler and Joseph Goebbels, two prominent Nazi leaders, seated in an open-top car during a parade. They are wearing military uniforms with Nazi insignia, including swastikas on their collars and armbands. Hitler is smiling and gesturing, while Goebbels looks forward. The background shows a crowd of people, many wearing Nazi party attire, waving and cheering. This scene represents a moment of public celebration and propaganda during the Nazi regime."@en .
