<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01382#reproductive_autonomy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The principle that individuals have the right to make decisions about their own reproductive health without coercion or interference from others. This concept is central to the pro-choice movement and is directly referenced in the text 'my body my choice'. The meme's visual of erasing 'Abortion' is a direct challenge to this principle, as it implies that abortion should be removed from consideration, which is contrary to the pro-choice stance."@en .
