<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01276#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for a broad, universal audience. It leverages a universally positive and relatable image of a smiling child and a widely understood idiom ('a smile is worth a thousand words') to convey a message about the power of non-verbal communication and emotional expression. The lack of specific cultural, religious, or demographic markers makes it accessible to people across different backgrounds, ages, and locations."@en .
