<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01275#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses a confrontational visual of a Black man shouting at a press conference to dismiss a perceived threat or criticism, potentially reinforcing harmful stereotypes about Black men being aggressive or authoritative. The text 'voetsek!!!' (Afrikaans for 'go away') is used to forcefully reject the idea that 't willl stop eating palony and viannas', which could be interpreted as mocking or dismissing specific individuals or entities. While the intent may be satirical or ironic, the combination of the visual and text can activate harmful stereotypes and potentially cause offense or harm to the targeted individuals or communities."@en .
