<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#children_in_bomb_vest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A group of children dressed in white protective suits and head coverings are gathered around a smaller child who is wearing a vest resembling a bomb with red and black components. The children appear to be assisting or adjusting the vest on the smaller child. The scene suggests a staged or symbolic performance, possibly related to a nativity play as indicated by the text overlay. The spatial arrangement shows the children positioned closely around the central child, indicating a focused interaction."@en .
