<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01527#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for individuals who participate in running or other forms of physical exercise, as it humorously or empathetically depicts the universal experience of physical exhaustion or injury during such activities. The text 'oh no i can't run anymore' and the visual of holding the knee directly relate to the physical strain and limitations commonly encountered by runners and exercisers."@en .
