<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01258#smoking_woman_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman with dark skin tone and curly hair, wearing sunglasses and denim overalls, is holding and smoking a cigarette. The scene is framed to focus on her as the central subject, with a blurred background suggesting an outdoor public setting. The text overlay is positioned above and below her, framing her as the subject of the meme's message."@en .
_:N152d2faf4cef431ea2e6bbe9e3676131 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N89dae21ea46a4e7c8c3643acbe48ad28 .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#physical_exertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical exertion refers to the use of physical strength or energy, often involving strenuous activity. The background knowledge required to understand the meme is that 'mudding' is a physically demanding activity, which contrasts with the restful scene depicted in the image. This contrast is central to the meme's humor and relatability."@en .
