<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01392#girl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A young Black girl with curly dark hair, smiling broadly while holding a smartphone to her ear. She is wearing a purple shirt under denim overalls. Her expression is cheerful and innocent, suggesting she is engaged in a pleasant phone conversation. She is the central subject of the image and the focus of the meme's visual material."@en .
