<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#meme_object_01472> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#MemeObject> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#historical_event_reconquista> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The centuries-long series of wars by Christian kingdoms in the Iberian Peninsula to reconquer territories from Muslim rule (primarily the Moors). This historical event is referenced implicitly in the meme's false claim that 'Muslims invaded Europe', which is a simplification and misrepresentation of the complex history of the Iberian Peninsula."@en .
_:N4ffd73da91e14731844057ba6de716fa <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:N0e44e6de00d849dbb09b1c4d132c1c98 .
