<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the textual material 'when you forget to wash your hands' because the phrase 'you' directly addresses the viewer, making the scenario personal and relatable. The user is invited to imagine themselves in the situation described, thereby projecting themselves onto the textual message."@en .
_:N0adf96a5e7d347b482d618b88f76465f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nb7231d3863cf4d5e8d1617e3669fa6d1 .
