<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme trivializes a serious medical and personal situation involving abortion and financial hardship, potentially causing distress to individuals who have experienced such difficulties. The dark humor derived from an absurd and grotesque consequence ('put the baby back in') is insensitive and can be seen as harmful to those sensitive to reproductive health issues."@en .
