<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01483#cultural_expectation_of_religious_engagement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on the cultural expectation that religious gatherings, especially in mosques, involve active participation, attentiveness, and spiritual focus. The visual of boredom contradicts this expectation, creating the comedic effect. This cultural knowledge is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand the humor."@en .
