<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01325#Meme_Template> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This is a common internet meme format used to express exaggerated emotional reactions to events. The template 'when your [X] scores a goal' is used to humorously depict the intensity of fan reactions, often with a stock image of a person screaming or celebrating. The image of the man screaming is a classic example of this template."@en .
