<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#hand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The central visual material is a human hand, palm up, covered in a thick, dark, viscous, and shiny substance that appears to be oil or grease. The substance is dripping from the fingers, emphasizing the messiness and the need for cleaning. The hand is the primary focus, framed against a plain, light gray background, which makes the dark, glistening substance stand out. The skin tone of the hand is visible at the wrist and on the edges of the fingers, appearing light to medium, but the substance covers most of the hand, obscuring detailed skin characteristics. The hand is not wearing any gloves or accessories, and its posture (palm up, fingers slightly curled) suggests a gesture of offering or presenting, which contrasts with the gross state of the hand, enhancing the comedic effect of the meme."@en .
