<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01487#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses a derogatory and offensive slur ('retarded') to demean someone who forgets something, targeting an individual with a degrading label. This intent is abusive as it is designed to mock or insult, potentially threatening or humiliating the target, and provokes laughter or shock through the use of a harmful and outdated term."@en .
