<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#Adolf_Hitler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The dictator of Nazi Germany from 1933 to 1945, who was responsible for initiating World War II and orchestrating the Holocaust. His presence in the top image is central to understanding the propaganda and power display of the regime."@en .
