<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01465#harmful_text_divisive_messaging> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'there is difference between violating muslims and other muslims' is a deliberately misleading and inflammatory statement. It implies a false distinction between 'violating' Muslims (who may be seen as perpetrators of violence) and 'other' Muslims (who may be seen as victims or innocent bystanders). This is a common tactic in hate speech to sow division within the Muslim community and to justify violence or discrimination against Muslims."@en .
