<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01483#boredom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The central man is depicted with a visibly disinterested facial expression, resting his head on his hand in a classic gesture of boredom. His eyes appear glazed or unfocused, and his mouth is slightly downturned, conveying a lack of engagement or enthusiasm. This expression is the primary emotional cue in the image and is directly referenced in the overlaid text."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01359#meme_format> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#relatedTo> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01359#man_in_suit> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#assertion_about_01475> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme directly attacks Muslims by associating them with a violent, barbaric stereotype through the analogical mapping of Vlad the Impaler as a stand-in for Muslims, and by attributing to him a grotesque, sexualized act that dehumanizes the group."@en .
