<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01467#assertion_about_01467> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#asserts> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01467#happiness> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#neutral_calmness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The woman in the image has a composed, neutral facial expression with direct eye contact and a relaxed posture. Her expression conveys calmness and self-assurance, without any overt emotional display such as joy, sadness, or anger. This neutrality aligns with the message of the text, which emphasizes personal freedom and non-confrontational acceptance of cultural differences."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#overallintent_instance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "the overallintent"@en .
_:Nc9abd006284b496689843243510baac0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:N968ce5761de44dcba15730fadae58c3c .
_:Nb36d19856acd4ddf9849aa8702b03b61 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#AnalogicalMapping> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01284#hatred> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is hatred, directed towards Muslims, as conveyed by the text 'muslims offend me' and reinforced by the visual of a person wearing a pig mask, which symbolizes dehumanization and animalization. This creates a hateful stereotype that incites prejudice and discrimination."@en .
