<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01325#ecstasy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The man's facial expression, with his mouth wide open in a scream, eyes narrowed, and teeth bared, conveys an extreme, almost primal state of joy or exhilaration. This is juxtaposed with the text 'when your world cup team scores a goal' to humorously represent the overwhelming happiness and excitement of a soccer fan celebrating a goal."@en .
