<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01243#dog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A white and tan pit bull-type dog with floppy ears, a pink tongue out, and a happy, panting expression, looking directly up at the camera. The dog is the central visual focus of the image, positioned in the foreground against a green grassy background. It wears a pink collar, indicating it is a pet. The dog's facial features, including its wide eyes and open mouth, convey a joyful and self-aware demeanor, which is central to the meme's humor."@en .
