<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#isis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A terrorist organization that has been responsible for numerous acts of violence and atrocities worldwide. The meme uses this real-world entity to create a harmful stereotype by associating it with sexualized and vulgar behavior, which is both inaccurate and dehumanizing. This association is offensive and contributes to a hostile environment by normalizing harmful attitudes against a specific group."@en .
