<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01325#man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A man with an intense, screaming facial expression, wearing a purple and white headscarf, set against a bright blue sky. His mouth is wide open, showing teeth, and his eyes are narrowed, conveying extreme emotion. He appears to be of Middle Eastern or North African descent, based on his facial features and head covering. The headscarf is wrapped tightly around his head and neck, with a frayed end visible on the right side. He is wearing a light-colored, patterned shirt. The man is the central focus of the image, framed from the chest up, and his exaggerated expression is the most salient visual element."@en .
