<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01379#propaganda_through_emotional_appeal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A technique used to influence public opinion by evoking strong emotions such as pity, guilt, or inspiration. In the context of this meme, the image and text are designed to elicit an emotional response that may lead viewers to support a particular cause or narrative without critically examining its underlying assumptions or power dynamics."@en .
