<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01359#area_51> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A highly classified United States Air Force facility located in Nevada, known for its association with UFOs, alien conspiracy theories, and public fascination. The term 'Area 51' is widely recognized in popular culture as a symbol of secrecy and restricted access, making it a common reference point in memes and jokes about 'breaking into' secret or forbidden places."@en .
