<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01276#happiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The child's wide, genuine smile and bright eyes convey a state of pure, unadulterated happiness. The upward curve of the lips, the crinkling around the eyes, and the relaxed posture all contribute to an expression of authentic joy and contentment, visually reinforcing the meme's message about the power of positive emotion."@en .
