<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#curiosity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The child is looking directly at the camera with a neutral to slightly curious expression, suggesting interest or mild surprise at being photographed in the messy bathroom scene."@en .
