<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01526#retail_checkout_transaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on the common real-world understanding of a retail checkout transaction, where a cashier processes payment and provides a bag for purchased items. The absurdity of the text ('put the money in a bag') is only humorous in the context of this familiar transactional setting."@en .
