<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01492#woman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman standing on a beach, wearing a black swimsuit and a pink visor. She is the central subject of the image, framed to highlight her physical appearance, including her skin tone, body type, and the visor she is wearing. Her facial expression and posture are neutral to slightly confrontational, contributing to the meme's humorous or ironic tone."@en .
