<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01497#man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A man with a full beard and mustache, wearing a white head covering (kufi or similar) and a light-colored traditional shirt. He is holding a child and appears to be standing in a doorway. His facial expression is neutral to serious, and he is looking slightly upward and to his right. His attire and the setting suggest a cultural or religious context, possibly Islamic, given the head covering and the meme's text. He is the central human subject in the image."@en .
