<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#concept_gas_mask_as_protection_from_toxic_substances> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The soldier in the image is wearing a gas mask, which is a piece of equipment designed to protect against toxic gases or biological agents. This is background knowledge that helps understand the soldier's role as a protector or combatant in a hazardous environment. The meme uses this visual to imply that the soldier is a 'hero' or 'protector' who is capable of handling extreme threats, which is then twisted to justify violence against a Muslim child."@en .
