<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#contempt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The top panel shows Adolf Hitler smiling and gesturing while seated in a parade car, surrounded by cheering crowds. This expression conveys a sense of arrogant satisfaction and contempt for the suffering of others, which is reinforced by the juxtaposition with the bottom panel showing victims. The text 'they see them rollin.....' adds a layer of ironic detachment, suggesting the leaders are oblivious to or indifferent to the suffering they cause."@en .
