<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01527#physical_discomfort_during_running> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person with a dark skin tone is shown from the waist down, holding their right knee with both hands, suggesting pain or exhaustion. The person is wearing black athletic shorts and a black wristband. The posture and gesture indicate physical discomfort or fatigue, likely from running, as implied by the text overlay. The scene is set on a road with a blurred background, emphasizing the individual's struggle. The text overlay 'oh no i can't run anymore' reinforces the context of physical limitation during exercise."@en .
