<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01476#self_confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The woman's calm, self-assured facial expression and confident pose with hands on hips convey a strong sense of self-confidence. Her direct gaze and relaxed demeanor, combined with the empowering text 'im confident in my own skin', reinforce this emotion. The prosthetic arms are presented as part of her identity without any indication of struggle, further emphasizing self-acceptance and empowerment."@en .
