<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01324#media_meme_format> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The format of internet memes that juxtapose an image with ironic or absurd text to create humor. This meme follows the common structure of 'image + text' where the text provides a humorous or satirical reinterpretation of the visual content. The background knowledge required to understand this meme includes familiarity with internet meme culture and the conventions of visual humor, which rely on the audience's ability to recognize the incongruity between the image and the text."@en .
