<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01459#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman sitting in fear surrounded by spiders, as the meme's humor and irony rely on the viewer identifying with her distress and the absurdity of the situation. The text 'trust me...' invites the user to imagine themselves in her position, making the projection onto the scene and the visual material central to the meme's effect."@en .
