<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#terrorism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The use of violence or threats of violence to achieve political, religious, or ideological goals, often targeting civilians. The visual of children in bomb vests is a direct and disturbing association with terrorism, which is the core of the meme's dark humor and potential harm. The background knowledge of terrorism is necessary to interpret the visual metaphor."@en .
