<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01327#Heath_Ledger> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The real-world actor who portrayed the Joker in 'The Dark Knight'. His performance is iconic and widely recognized, making the visual representation of the character instantly understandable to audiences familiar with the film."@en .
_:N1b23fa0d38d641058e9ce9f86c86b016 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TextualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01439#goat_mating_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scene depicting two goats engaged in mating behavior on a rocky terrain. The top goat is mounted on the bottom goat, creating a visual pun related to the text overlay. The scene is set outdoors on a sunny day with a clear blue sky and rocky landscape."@en .
