<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The top text 'father and daughter bonding time is the best' is mapped onto the visual scene of the elderly man (father) and younger woman (daughter) embracing warmly. The text explicitly labels their affectionate interaction as 'the best' bonding time, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the father-daughter embrace) is identified as the concept described in the text."@en .
