<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01459#terrorism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'they're re all terrorists' references the real-world concept of terrorism, which is a serious and often politically charged term. The meme's humor comes from the absurd juxtaposition of this term with spiders, which requires understanding the gravity and connotation of 'terrorist' in the real world."@en .
