<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'nativity play' is juxtaposed with the visual of children dressed in protective suits and one wearing a bomb-like vest. This creates an analogical mapping where the innocent, religious context of a nativity play is metaphorically equated with the violent imagery of children in bomb vests, implying the play was a 'bomb' or dangerous event. The mapping is darkly ironic and relies on the contrast between childhood innocence and terrorism."@en .
