<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01276#smiling_child_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scene featuring a young boy with light blonde hair and a cheerful smile, wearing a blue V-neck t-shirt, positioned in the foreground against a blurred green outdoor background. The scene is framed to emphasize the child's joyful expression, which is visually reinforced by the text overlay 'a smile is worth a thousand words'. The spatial arrangement places the child centrally, with the background providing a natural, soft-focus environment that draws attention to the subject."@en .
