<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01327#Joker_character> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A villainous anti-hero from the Batman universe, known for his chaotic, anarchic, and morally ambiguous nature. The meme uses his persona to convey a darkly humorous message about embracing a twisted identity."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#diagonallyAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:N5ba1e929d9d443f480aade068ca900be .
