<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01324#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme creates a harmful juxtaposition by labeling ordinary-looking men as 'the great train robbers', which could trivialize or misrepresent real historical criminals. While the intent is humorous, the mapping can be seen as potentially harmful by reducing complex historical figures to a comedic stereotype, which may disrespect the victims or the gravity of the event."@en .
