<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The target community is individuals familiar with internet meme culture, particularly those who understand and appreciate the juxtaposition of historical imagery with modern slang (e.g., 'they see them rollin.....', 'they hating...') for comedic or satirical effect. This audience is likely to recognize the reference to hip-hop culture and the meme format's use of contrast to create a punchline, even if the content is historically sensitive."@en .
