<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01395#mexican_food_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This is a common, though often oversimplified, stereotype about Mexican cuisine. The meme uses this stereotype as the basis for its offensive joke, implying that the 'heat' of the food is metaphorically transferred to the babies, which is a crude and culturally insensitive comparison."@en .
