<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#cultural_relativism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The idea that a person's beliefs and activities should be understood in terms of their own culture, rather than judged against the standards of another. The meme promotes this idea by highlighting that the woman's choice to wear the hijab is respected and permitted in different cultural contexts."@en .
_:Nda486cf52ee74c5a9cde4f5ed020c8eb <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
