<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#Meme_culture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The internet-based phenomenon of creating and sharing humorous or satirical images, often with text overlays, to comment on current events or historical events. The meme format used here is a common way to juxtapose contrasting images to create a powerful message."@en .
