<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01275#shouting_at_press_conference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Black man in a suit is depicted shouting aggressively at a press conference, with multiple microphones in front of him. His facial expression is intense, with furrowed brows and a strained look, emphasizing the confrontational nature of the scene. He is pointing with one hand, indicating a strong, possibly defiant or dismissive stance. The scene is framed to focus on his emotional intensity and the context of public address."@en .
