<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#Nazi_propaganda> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The systematic effort by the Nazi regime to control public opinion and promote its ideology through media, art, and public events. The top image is a classic example of Nazi propaganda, showing leaders in a celebratory parade to create a sense of national unity and power."@en .
