<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#DACA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A U.S. immigration policy established in 2012 that provides temporary protection from deportation and work authorization to certain individuals who were brought to the United States as children without legal status. It is a central policy reference in the meme's text, requiring knowledge of U.S. immigration law and political discourse."@en .
