<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01487#sirius_radio> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A satellite radio service that broadcasts music and talk shows. The event is taking place at a Sirius Radio event, which is a branded promotional or public appearance. The context of the event (a Sirius Radio event) is necessary to understand the setting and the nature of the public figure involved."@en .
