<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01275#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for an internet audience familiar with meme culture, particularly those who recognize the 'angry Black man' template and understand the Afrikaans word 'voetsek'. The target community likely includes users who appreciate satirical or sarcastic humor, especially those who are aware of the cultural context of the visual and textual elements. The meme may also appeal to audiences who are familiar with or have an interest in South African culture or language, given the use of Afrikaans. The intended audience is likely to be online communities that engage with political or social commentary through humor, and who are comfortable with the use of exaggerated or stereotypical imagery for comedic effect."@en .
