<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01349#historical_event_Holocaust> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. This event is central to understanding the horror associated with Adolf Hitler and the profound moral condemnation of his actions. The meme's intent to trivialize or sanitize his legacy by juxtaposing him with a childlike, affectionate image is deeply harmful because it ignores the genocide he orchestrated."@en .
