<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01389#affection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person is holding the cat close to their face with a gentle smile and closed eyes, indicating a tender, loving, and affectionate emotional state towards the cat. The physical closeness and facial expression convey warmth and care."@en .
