<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01275#meme_format_using_angry_Black_man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This meme format relies on the visual of an angry Black man to convey a message of defiance or rejection. The background knowledge required is the recognition of this meme template and its common usage in internet culture to express strong opinions or dismissive attitudes. This template is often used humorously or sarcastically, and understanding its cultural context is necessary to interpret the meme's intent."@en .
