<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#pados_wale_pandit_jee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used in Indian internet culture, often in a mocking or demeaning manner, to refer to certain politicians or religious leaders perceived as self-important, overly confident, or out of touch. It is a stereotype that implies these individuals are viewed as threatening or intimidating by certain groups, even if they appear ordinary to others. The term is not a real-world entity but a cultural reference that requires external knowledge to understand its connotation and the meme's intent."@en .
_:N4a72130e8e624707b930d89805eaba01 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nab1eea46f1fa4168b6cbe4cda663280c .
