<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#text_overlay> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'meanwhile at the isis strip club' is overlaid on the image in bold, white font with a black outline. This text is a key element of the meme, providing context and humor by juxtaposing the two images."@en .
