_:Nd454e36bf8f440af9fb68d2c090dd692 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01276#concept_emotional_expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This refers to the outward manifestation of internal feelings through facial expressions, body language, or verbal communication. The meme uses the child's smile as a powerful example of emotional expression, suggesting that such expressions can be more effective than words in conveying empathy, warmth, or understanding."@en .
