<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#hate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is hate, conveyed through the violent, dehumanizing, and grotesque text that falsely associates Muslims with Vlad the Impaler and attributes to him a monstrous, sexualized act. The overall intent of the meme is to incite prejudice and hostility toward Muslims by invoking a violent, barbaric stereotype."@en .
