_:N2f2cfe6b6b6e4f729ffc5c35fbb8dd8f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01275#overallintent_instance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a Black man in a suit, appearing to shout aggressively at a press conference, with multiple microphones in front of him. The text overlay reads, 'if you think t willl stop eating palony and viannas voetsek!!!' The phrase 'voetsek' is Afrikaans for 'go away' or 'get lost,' and the mention of 'palony' and 'viannas' (likely misspellings of 'palo' and 'vianna,' possibly referring to specific individuals or entities) suggests a context of confrontation or dismissal. The meme uses the visual of an angry, authoritative figure to convey a message of defiance or rejection. The overall intent is to communicate a strong, possibly humorous or sarcastic, rejection of a perceived threat or criticism. The meme does not contain explicit abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements. The intent is to use the image of a confrontational figure to emphasize a dismissive or defiant stance, likely in a satirical or ironic context."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#assertion_about_01475> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#asserts> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#hate> .
