<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01359#audience_id_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for individuals familiar with internet meme formats, particularly the three-panel narrative structure. The humor relies on understanding the absurd juxtaposition of fictional characters ('Naruto Runners') attempting to enter a real-world secret location ('Area 51'), a trope common in online humor. The audience is expected to recognize the comedic exaggeration and the visual storytelling technique."@en .
