<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01276#concept_positive_emotional_connection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This refers to the psychological and social bond formed through shared positive emotions, empathy, and mutual understanding. The meme promotes this concept by suggesting that a simple smile can foster or strengthen such connections, making it a tool for building rapport and reducing conflict."@en .
