<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#hijab> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A headscarf worn by Muslim women as a religious and cultural symbol of modesty and faith. Its presence in the image and the text implies a discussion about religious freedom and cultural norms regarding attire across different countries."@en .
