<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#assad> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'Assad' refers to Bashar al-Assad, the President of Syria, who is a real-world political entity. The meme uses his name to imply a boastful or competitive comparison, which is a form of political satire or trolling. This requires background knowledge of who Assad is to understand the meme's intent and potential toxicity."@en .
