<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#messy_bathroom_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A young child stands in a bathroom next to a toilet with the lid up, surrounded by scattered toilet paper on the floor and sink, indicating a chaotic or 'exploded' state. The child is holding a doll and looking at the camera. The scene is framed to emphasize the mess and the child's presence within it."@en .
