<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01483#boredom_in_religious_context> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on the ironic juxtaposition of religious solemnity with the mundane concept of boredom. This requires understanding that religious gatherings are often expected to be serious, focused, or spiritually uplifting, making the visual of boredom in such a setting inherently humorous or absurd to those familiar with the cultural expectation. The humor stems from the contrast between the expected gravity of the setting and the depicted lack of engagement."@en .
