<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01324#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'the great train robbers' is overlaid on the image of a group of seven older men holding books, creating an analogical mapping where the group of men is being labeled as the infamous criminals from the 1963 Great Train Robbery. This mapping is humorous and ironic, as the men appear ordinary and are holding books, contrasting sharply with the dramatic criminal connotation of the text. The mapping is established through direct textual labeling of the visual group."@en .
