<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01459#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'they're re all terrorists' refers to the spiders surrounding the woman. The visual entity 'fearful_woman_surrounded_by_spiders' is the context in which the spiders are present, and the text implicitly maps the spiders (the group surrounding her) as 'they'. The woman's fear and the spiders' presence create the scenario for this mapping, where the spiders are the subject of the overgeneralization claim. The mapping is established through the visual context of the spiders being the objects of fear and the textual claim that they are all terrorists."@en .
