<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01467#honky_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The term 'honky' is a derogatory racial slur historically used to demean white people, particularly in the context of racial discrimination and white supremacy. It is often used to reinforce negative stereotypes about white people, especially in relation to their perceived cultural or social behaviors. The term carries a history of systemic racism and oppression, and its use in this meme is intended to be offensive and hateful."@en .
