<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#visual_metaphor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses a visual metaphor — a hand covered in a disgusting substance — to represent the abstract concept of neglecting a simple, everyday task (washing hands). This requires the viewer to understand that the image is not literal but symbolic, a common technique in humor and satire to make a point in an exaggerated, memorable way."@en .
_:N0caaba9d703f4dbda07b0989917380c4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
