_:N017d67d2a10b4eb6b6ef81b6ac83c64b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nd1ac72fac97f469cabe00a7b8b25c934 .
_:Nb0c17eaa62444e6481a0439059da97b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TextualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01392#modern_phone_call_culture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image of a young girl on a phone call is a common visual trope in modern media, representing communication, connection, and everyday life. The meme uses this familiar context to create humor by contrasting it with a religious invocation. This cultural reference relies on the viewer's understanding of how people interact via phones in contemporary society, which is a widespread and non-controversial aspect of modern life."@en .
