_:Neb8b2ec21a3e4a33b09e4984ba30c1b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01465#harmful_stereotype_muslims_as_terrorists> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that all or most Muslims are inherently violent or terrorist-like, by visually associating them with bomb props and using text that implies a distinction between 'violating' and 'other' Muslims, which can be interpreted as endorsing or normalizing violence against Muslims. This stereotype is widely circulated in Western media and politics and is used to dehumanize and demonize Muslim communities."@en .
_:N993fc967dca9459e9a606e034c443cf2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nd384e6811a7d48cc99585928b86c80ac .
