<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for a broad, universal audience with no specific demographic, cultural, or community markers. It relies on a universally understood concept — personal hygiene — and uses a universally relatable visual (a dirty hand) to convey a lighthearted, cautionary message. The target community is anyone who understands the basic concept of handwashing and can appreciate the comedic exaggeration of its consequences, making it accessible across age groups, cultures, and backgrounds."@en .
