<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#religious_symbolism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The use of symbols, imagery, or narratives to represent religious beliefs or events. The nativity play is steeped in religious symbolism, and the meme's humor relies on the audience understanding this context to appreciate the irony. The background knowledge of religious symbolism is necessary to interpret the contrast between the sacred and the violent."@en .
