_:N63e4ad8cabc542668351922bf1955be0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01476#self_acceptance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The psychological state of accepting oneself, including one's flaws, differences, and imperfections. This concept is central to the meme's message, which encourages viewers to find confidence in their own skin, regardless of societal norms or physical differences."@en .
