<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01324#humor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The overall expression conveyed by the image and text is humorous, stemming from the ironic juxtaposition of ordinary-looking men holding books with the label 'the great train robbers'. The men's neutral to smiling expressions, combined with the absurdity of the text, create a comedic effect. The black-and-white photograph style adds to the satirical tone, mimicking a historical documentary while subverting expectations."@en .
