<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01325#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the scenario described by the text 'when your world cup team scores a goal', which implies personal identification with the fan experience. The user is not directly projected onto a specific visual material (like the man's face) but onto the conceptual scene of fan ecstasy, which is embodied by the visual material. The deictic 'your' in the text explicitly directs the projection toward the viewer/user, making them the 'you' whose team scores."@en .
