<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01275#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The visual of the Black man shouting aggressively at a press conference is mapped onto the textual content 'if you think t willl stop eating palony and viannas voetsek!!!'. The man's confrontational posture and expression are used to represent the act of forcefully rejecting or dismissing the notion expressed in the text. The text 'voetsek!!!' (Afrikaans for 'go away' or 'get lost') is the explicit verbalization of this rejection, which is visually embodied by the man's angry demeanor and gesture. The mapping is between the textual concept of rejection and the visual representation of an angry, authoritative figure."@en .
