<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01392#phone_call_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A young Black girl is engaged in a phone conversation, holding a smartphone to her ear while smiling. The scene is framed to focus on her cheerful expression and the act of communication, with text overlays suggesting a humorous or religious context. The girl is the sole participant, and the phone is the object she is interacting with."@en .
