<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01379#stereotype_of_african_children_as_helpless> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A pervasive and harmful stereotype that portrays African children as inherently vulnerable, in need of rescue or charity, and lacking agency or complex social realities. This stereotype is often reinforced by media portrayals and charitable campaigns that focus on pity or donation rather than empowerment or systemic change."@en .
