<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01275#Black_man_in_a_suit_shouting_at_press_conference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image of a Black man in a suit shouting at a press conference can activate stereotypes that associate Black men with aggression, authority, or defiance. While the image itself is neutral, the combination of visual cues (Black skin tone, suit, aggressive posture) with the text can reinforce or invoke cultural stereotypes. This is background knowledge needed to understand the potential social or cultural implications of the meme."@en .
