<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01467#racial_slur_context> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The term 'honky' is a racial slur that has been used historically to demean white people, particularly in the context of racial discrimination and white supremacy. Its use in this meme is not neutral or humorous; it is a direct attack on a racial group, invoking a history of systemic racism and oppression. The meme is designed to provoke discomfort and reinforce racial stereotypes, making it clearly hateful and potentially harmful to white individuals and communities."@en .
