<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#assertion_about_01498> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme presents a racially charged historical argument by implying that white people as a collective group are still responsible for historical injustices committed by their ancestors, which oversimplifies complex historical and legal issues and may polarize viewers. This framing can cause harm by promoting divisive racialized historical narratives and encouraging specific political stances."@en .
