_:N8ae8b1f9c9a040c3a1d6b5c1cf6dc425 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nfecbe6bac7e8429cb208172372ff07ea .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01382#abortion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The medical procedure to terminate a pregnancy. It is a highly politicized and socially debated topic. The word 'Abortion' written on the chalkboard and being erased is a direct reference to this concept. The meme's visual metaphor of erasing the word implies a rejection or removal of abortion from consideration, which is contrary to the pro-choice message expressed in the text."@en .
