<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01349#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme depicts Adolf Hitler, a historical figure responsible for genocide and the Holocaust, in a seemingly affectionate pose with a young girl. The overlaid text, 'girl you're so special' and 'i'm gonna give you a gold star,' creates a jarring and inappropriate juxtaposition. This is not a benign or humorous comparison but a harmful act of historical revisionism that trivializes the atrocities committed by Hitler. By associating him with a childlike, nurturing, or affectionate image, the meme attempts to normalize or sanitize his monstrous legacy. The intent is to shock or provoke through the absurd contrast, but it is deeply harmful as it risks desensitizing viewers to the real-world consequences of his actions and could be seen as a form of propaganda that distorts historical memory."@en .
