<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#contempt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Adolf Hitler's stern, unsmiling gaze and rigid facial posture convey a sense of disdain or contempt, consistent with his historical persona as a figure of authoritarianism and hatred. His direct stare and set jaw suggest a dismissive or superior attitude."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#perimeterFraming> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:N1df3e10bae17492db8a56e1f5fd027c5 .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#toxicity_1> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#extractedFrom> "01348.png" .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#concept_tactical_gear_as_military_equipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The soldier is wearing full tactical gear, which is standard equipment for military or special forces personnel. This is background knowledge that helps understand the soldier's role as a combatant or enforcer. The meme uses this visual to frame the act of violence as a 'military' or 'professional' act, thereby lending it an air of legitimacy or heroism."@en .
