<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01325#person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme targets individuals who are passionate supporters of their national soccer team, particularly during major international tournaments like the FIFA World Cup. The exaggerated visual of the man screaming is used to humorously represent the intense, almost primal joy that fans experience when their team scores a goal. The target audience is therefore anyone who identifies with or follows national soccer teams and understands the cultural phenomenon of fan ecstasy."@en .
