<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01395#pain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The woman in labor is visibly in extreme physical pain, with her mouth wide open in a scream, eyes squeezed shut, and facial muscles tensed, conveying the agony of childbirth. This is a direct and visceral expression of suffering."@en .
