<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01467#man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A smiling man with short dark hair, wearing a purple V-neck shirt, giving two thumbs up. His facial expression is cheerful and enthusiastic, with a wide grin and crinkled eyes, suggesting positivity or approval. He is the central subject of the image and the primary visual material."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01452#chimp_anthropomorphism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses the chimp's posture to humorously represent human emotions and experiences. This requires background knowledge of anthropomorphism — the attribution of human characteristics to non-human entities — which is a common trope in humor, cartoons, and memes to create relatable and amusing analogies."@en .
