<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01349#stereotype_trivializing_genocide> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses the juxtaposition of Hitler's image with a seemingly innocent, affectionate interaction to trivialize the genocide he committed. This is a dangerous stereotype that risks normalizing or minimizing the horror of the Holocaust, making it a form of cultural and historical harm."@en .
