<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#toxicity_harmful> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is intended to provoke laughter through shock value and absurd comparison, but the use of 'exploded' in a context involving children and bodily mess can be seen as insensitive or potentially offensive. This requires background knowledge of content moderation and toxicity to understand the meme's potential harm."@en .
