<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01284#person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The central figure is a person with light brown hair, wearing a realistic pig mask that covers their face, featuring pig ears, snout, and a wide grin. The person is holding a small pig figurine. The mask is a key visual element, symbolizing animalization and dehumanization, and is used to create a harmful stereotype. The person is wearing a dark green long-sleeved shirt."@en .
