<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01487#woman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman with glasses, wearing a pink jacket over a purple shirt, holding a sign at a public event. She appears to be in a professional or promotional setting, possibly at a radio station event. Her facial expression is neutral to slightly surprised or confused, and she is looking directly at the camera. She is the central subject of the image and the focus of the meme's visual material."@en .
