<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#Stereotype_White_People_as_Collective_Historical_Agents> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A racial stereotype that implies white people as a collective group are responsible for historical injustices committed by their ancestors, often used in political discourse to frame debates about reparations, historical memory, and moral responsibility. The meme invokes this stereotype to make its argument, requiring understanding of racialized historical narratives and their social implications."@en .
