<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01349#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The top text overlay 'girl you're so special' is projected onto the visual entity Adolf_Hitler, who is depicted in a seemingly affectionate pose with a young girl. This creates an analogical mapping where the text implies that Adolf_Hitler is addressing the girl as 'special', thereby mapping the textual entity 'girl you're so special' onto the visual entity 'Adolf_Hitler' as the speaker or actor of the affectionate interaction. This mapping is part of the harmful meme's intent to sanitize Hitler's legacy by associating him with a nurturing, childlike interaction."@en .
