<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01487#date_1_9_06> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The date '1-9-06' (January 9, 2006) is a specific point in time. It is necessary to understand the historical context of the event, as the meme references a specific past event. The date helps anchor the meme to a real-world moment, which may be relevant for understanding the cultural or social context of the insult."@en .
