<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#woman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman with light brown skin tone, wearing a beige headscarf (hijab), a black turtleneck, and a colorful patterned jacket. She is looking directly at the camera with a neutral expression, her right hand resting near her collar. Her facial features include defined eyebrows, dark eyes, and natural makeup. Her hair is covered by the headscarf, and she has a slender build. The woman is the central subject of the image, positioned in the foreground."@en .
