<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01395#mexican_babies_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme targets Mexican individuals and communities by using a racial stereotype that reduces them to a crude, offensive joke about their food and babies. The text 'i just found out mexican babies come out just like the food' directly references Mexican people, implying that their babies are 'spicy' or 'hot' like Mexican cuisine, which is a harmful and reductive cultural appropriation. The visual of childbirth is used to amplify the shock value of this stereotype, making the joke more offensive and targeted specifically at Mexican people."@en .
