<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01382#pro_choice_movement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for individuals who identify with or support the pro-choice movement, which advocates for reproductive autonomy and the right to access abortion services. The slogan 'my body my choice' is a well-known rallying cry for this community, and the visual metaphor of erasing 'Abortion' creates a provocative contrast that is likely intended to resonate with those familiar with the political discourse surrounding reproductive rights."@en .
_:Nff7ed295d7144343bca62901fb0e0120 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
