<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#humor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The man's broad smile and enthusiastic open-handed gesture convey a sense of exaggerated, absurd amusement, fitting the meme's crude and shocking humor. His expression is not genuine joy but a performative one meant to underscore the ridiculousness of the situation described in the text."@en .
