<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#nativity_play> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A traditional Christian religious play depicting the birth of Jesus Christ, commonly performed during the Christmas season, especially in schools and churches. The reference to a 'nativity play' in the text is crucial to understanding the meme's irony — juxtaposing the innocence and religious symbolism of a nativity play with the violent imagery of children in bomb vests."@en .
