<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#Stereotype_of_victims_as_innocent_and_helpless> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A common cultural stereotype that portrays victims of atrocities as innocent, helpless, and often children, emphasizing the tragedy and injustice of their suffering. This stereotype is reinforced by the bottom image showing children in striped uniforms behind barbed wire."@en .
