<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01395#racial_stereotyping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on racial stereotyping by associating a specific ethnic group (Mexicans) with a negative, reductive, and offensive joke. It also involves cultural appropriation by using a cultural element (Mexican food) in a context that trivializes and dehumanizes the group it represents."@en .
_:Nb32c2bd57cd946f489a2ce23e80c59f3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N18d97ab1872d4e55a2ba6178613aed65 .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#confrontation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The man's stern, intense gaze, crossed arms, and serious facial expression convey a confrontational or intimidating demeanor. This visual expression is used to symbolize the perceived threatening or intimidating view held by 'pados wale pandit jee'."@en .
