<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01379#charity_tourism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The practice of traveling to developing countries to engage in charitable activities, often framed as 'visiting' or 'helping' local populations. While sometimes well-intentioned, it can be criticized for being superficial, reinforcing power imbalances, and potentially exploiting local communities for the benefit of the tourist or donor."@en .
