<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#stereotype_muslims_as_terrorists> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A widely circulated and harmful stereotype that falsely equates all Muslims with terrorism, often used to justify discrimination and violence. The meme uses this stereotype by associating Muslims with a violent historical figure (Vlad) to perpetuate fear and hatred."@en .
