<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01456#assertion_about_01456> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme juxtaposes the celebration of Nazi leaders with the suffering of Holocaust victims, which can cause harm by trivializing or normalizing genocide and systemic atrocities. The use of hip-hop slang ('they see them rollin.....', 'they hating...') to describe the Nazi regime's actions and the victims' suffering is deeply insensitive and potentially reductive, minimizing the gravity of historical trauma."@en .
