<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01243#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the dog, which is visually depicted as the 'good girl' being praised. The text 'and you already know it's you' explicitly directs the user to identify with the dog's self-aware, joyful response to being called 'good girl'. The dog's happy expression and direct gaze create a humorous, anthropomorphic interaction that invites the user to imagine themselves in the dog's place, thus projecting the user's identity onto the dog as the subject of the praise."@en .
_:N01a0a4c5d8e54aa0a0e2bf1b41688955 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01524#concealed_weapon_threat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person in casual attire (black hoodie and blue jeans) is holding a handgun concealed behind their hip, suggesting a threatening or retaliatory action. The framing focuses on the weapon and the act of concealment, emphasizing the potential for violence."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#verticallyAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:N343dcb327b7645e6b7a65f2c6c295d6c .
