<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#religious_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that all members of the clergy are pedophiles or molesters. This is a false and dangerous stereotype that has been used historically to discredit religious institutions and individuals. The meme uses this stereotype to incite fear and hatred against religious figures, which is a form of hate speech and cyberbullying."@en .
