<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#shocked_reaction_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scene where a woman with a shocked or incredulous facial expression is the central visual element, overlaid with text that presents a rhetorical contrast about moral accountability. The scene is framed to emphasize her exaggerated expression as a reaction to the text's provocative claim."@en .
