<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A man with a stern, confrontational expression, wearing a ribbed beanie and a dark leather jacket, arms crossed. His facial features include a scruffy beard and intense gaze. The visual treatment includes desaturated, sepia-toned lighting, emphasizing his serious demeanor."@en .
