<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#pados_wale_pandit_jee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme targets individuals who are perceived as self-important or out of touch, often associated with certain Indian political or religious leaders. The term 'pados wale pandit jee' is a culturally specific reference used in Indian internet culture to mock or demean these figures, implying they view ordinary people as threatening. The target audience is likely Indian internet users familiar with this term and its connotation, who understand the humor in contrasting self-perception with the exaggerated perception of this stereotype."@en .
