<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01324#group_of_men_holding_books> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A group of seven older men standing outdoors in a row, some holding open books. The men are dressed in casual to semi-formal attire, and their expressions range from neutral to smiling. The scene is presented in a black-and-white photograph, suggesting a historical or documentary tone. The text overlay 'the great train robbers' adds a humorous or ironic juxtaposition, implying the men are being portrayed as criminals or notorious figures."@en .
