<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#assertion_about_01274> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme uses derogatory and stereotypical language ('pados wale pandit jee') to mock a specific group of Indian political or religious figures, which can be seen as demeaning and disrespectful. While not explicitly targeting protected groups, it promotes harmful stereotyping and could contribute to a hostile environment."@en .
