<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01483#mosque_as_a_place_of_worship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image is set in a mosque, which is a place of Islamic worship. Understanding that this is a religious institution, not just a building, is essential to interpret the context. The meme's humor depends on the viewer recognizing that the setting is meant to be a place of spiritual activity, which contrasts with the text's suggestion of boredom as a reason to go there."@en .
