<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01483#mapping_id_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'feeling bored' is directly mapped onto the visual of the central man, who is depicted with a bored expression. The meme uses this visual representation to embody the textual sentiment, creating an analogical mapping where the man's facial expression and posture serve as the visual instantiation of the feeling described in the text."@en .
