<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01276#child> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A young boy with light blonde hair and a cheerful smile, wearing a blue V-neck t-shirt. He is the central subject of the image, positioned in the foreground, and his joyful expression is the focal point, visually reinforcing the meme's message about the power of a smile."@en .
