<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#traditional_attire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The men are wearing traditional garments, likely thobes or dishdashas, which are loose-fitting robes commonly worn in the Middle East and North Africa. This attire is culturally specific and contributes to the visual context."@en .
