<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01452#exhaustion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The chimp's relaxed, slightly slumped posture with one arm draped over its body and the other resting on its knee conveys a sense of physical and mental fatigue, humorously equated to the feeling after a long day at work. This is an anthropomorphized expression of weariness and resignation."@en .
