<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01395#woman_in_labor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman with dark hair and dark skin tone, wearing a hospital gown with a pattern of small blue dots, is lying in a hospital bed. Her facial expression shows extreme pain and exertion, with her mouth wide open as if screaming. She is holding hands with a man beside her. Her body is partially covered by a white hospital blanket. This is the central visual subject and the primary focus of the image, conveying intense physical suffering."@en .
