<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#sexual_humor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A genre of humor that involves crude, explicit, or taboo sexual references. The meme relies on this type of humor to create its comedic effect, which is often considered offensive or inappropriate. The text explicitly references sexual desire ('feeling horny') and proposes an absurd solution, which is a hallmark of sexual humor."@en .
