<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01392#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'hello jesus' is positioned above the girl's head, creating an analogical mapping where the girl is visually represented as the entity being addressed by the text. This implies that the girl is the one speaking to or invoking Jesus, as if she were the one saying 'hello jesus' in the context of the phone call. The mapping is established through spatial adjacency and the humorous juxtaposition of a casual phone call with a religious invocation."@en .
