<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01327#Joker> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The central figure is the Joker, a fictional character from the Batman universe, portrayed by Heath Ledger in 'The Dark Knight'. He is shown in a close-up shot with a menacing expression, smeared white face paint, dark eye makeup, and a wide, unsettling grin. His hair is disheveled and dark, and he wears a dark-colored shirt. The visual material emphasizes his chaotic and villainous persona, which is central to the meme's intent."@en .
