<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01258#stereotype_of_men_as_homophobic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme implies that men who are offended by the woman smoking are homophobic, which is a stereotype that frames men as intolerant of homosexuality or non-heteronormative behavior. This stereotype is used to attack the men"@en .
