<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01382#protest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is one of protest or defiance, conveyed through the visual act of erasing the word 'Abortion' and juxtaposed with the slogan 'my body my choice'. The action of erasing symbolizes rejection or opposition to the concept of abortion, while the text asserts a pro-choice stance, creating a paradoxical or provocative emotional message intended to challenge or provoke debate on reproductive rights."@en .
