<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man (person) as a representation of 'how you guys think you looks like'. The top text explicitly addresses the viewer ('you guys'), directing them to see themselves in the image. The man's ordinary appearance (scruffy beard, beanie, leather jacket) is used to symbolize the viewer's self-perception, creating a direct projection of the user's identity onto this visual entity."@en .
