<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01327#The_Dark_Knight> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The film in which the Joker character is portrayed, providing context for the visual material. The meme relies on the audience recognizing this specific cinematic work to understand the character's origin and the tone of the scene."@en .
