<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The woman's expression of incredulity is mapped onto the rhetorical question in the bottom text, which challenges the perceived inconsistency in moral accountability by asking if white people should still be held responsible for 17th-century slave owners. Her visual reaction serves as a proxy for the viewer's supposed reaction to this provocative claim."@en .
