<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01364#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme depicts children dressed in protective suits with one wearing a bomb-like vest, juxtaposed with text about a nativity play, creating a darkly ironic and potentially harmful message that normalizes or trivializes violence, especially when associated with children. This can cause distress or promote negative associations."@en .
