<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#white_turbans> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The men are wearing white turbans, which are head coverings with religious or cultural significance, commonly associated with certain Muslim communities. The turbans are a key visual marker in the image."@en .
