<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#tolerance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ability to accept or respect ideas, beliefs, or behaviors that are different from one's own. The meme promotes tolerance by suggesting that people should be open to the idea that others may choose to wear religious attire, even if it is not common in their own culture."@en .
