<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01487#meme_abusive_intent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed to be abusive and insulting, using a derogatory term ('retarded') to demean someone who forgets something. This intent is not visible in the image but is implied by the text overlay and the context of the image. The meme's intent is to provoke laughter or shock through the use of a harmful and outdated term, which can cause emotional harm and perpetuate stigma against people with disabilities."@en .
