<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01452#chimp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A chimpanzee is the central subject, sitting on grass in a relaxed, slightly slumped posture with one arm draped over its body and the other resting on its knee, conveying a sense of exhaustion or resignation. The chimp's dark fur and facial features are clearly visible, and it is positioned centrally in the frame."@en .
