_:N13e2804b72d6487c8d1e3d420d586800 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TextualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01293#overallintent_instance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts a hand covered in a thick, dark, viscous substance, with drips falling from the fingers, against a plain background. The text overlay reads 'when you forget to wash your hands.' The image uses a strong visual metaphor to humorously illustrate the consequences of neglecting basic hygiene. There are no elements that point to any specific group of people through physical appearance, clothing, behavior, or context that would activate stereotypes or harmful associations. The meme is intended to be a lighthearted, cautionary reminder about personal hygiene, using the visual of a grossly dirty hand to emphasize the unpleasantness of not washing hands. The intent is purely comedic and educational, with no abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic content. The visual material (dirty hand) is mapped onto the textual material (forgetting to wash hands) via juxtaposition to create a humorous and relatable analogy."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01389#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#SemioticProjection> .
