<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#goat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A domesticated mammal, often kept for meat, milk, or as a pet. In the meme, it is presented as an absurd, crude, and inappropriate substitute for human romantic or sexual partners, highlighting the meme's shock value and offensive humor. The use of a goat as a sexual object is a stereotype that can be linked to harmful tropes about certain cultures or religions."@en .
