<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01327#joker_monologue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Joker, with a menacing expression and smeared white face paint, is the central figure in the scene. He is positioned in the foreground, looking directly at the viewer or an unseen person. The background is dark and blurred, suggesting an indoor setting. The scene is framed to emphasize the Joker's unsettling grin and intense gaze, conveying a sense of psychological intensity. Text overlays are present, but the scene is primarily focused on the Joker's presence and expression."@en .
