<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01389#mall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A shopping mall is a large building or complex that houses multiple retail stores, restaurants, and sometimes entertainment venues. It is a common public space for leisure and shopping. The meme references taking a cat to the mall, which is an unusual and humorous activity, implying a deviation from typical pet behavior."@en .
