<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01274#taba_renso> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A username or handle associated with the creation or popularization of this meme. It is not visible in the image but is required to understand the meme's origin and context. The name may be a reference to a specific individual or online persona known for creating or sharing such content."@en .
