<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01325#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'when your world cup team scores a goal' is mapped onto the visual of the man screaming with intense emotion. The man's exaggerated, primal scream is used analogically to represent the extreme joy and ecstasy a soccer fan feels when their national team scores a goal during the World Cup. The mapping is direct: the visual entity (man screaming) is the embodiment of the textual concept (fan ecstasy)."@en .
_:N18bd6b90d582401faef23ab800938daf <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> .
