<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#traditional_Middle_Eastern_clothing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The men are wearing long, loose-fitting garments that are typical of traditional Middle Eastern attire. The clothing appears to be light-colored, possibly beige or cream, and is worn in conjunction with the turbans."@en .
