<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01459#stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme implicitly references the real-world stereotype of labeling entire groups (e.g., religious, ethnic, or political groups) as inherently dangerous or evil. The humor arises from applying this stereotype to spiders, which are not human groups. Understanding this stereotype is key to interpreting the meme's satirical intent."@en .
