<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#toilet_explosion_meme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This meme format uses a visual of a child's messy bathroom to imply a competitive, boastful, or mocking comparison between two individuals. The term 'exploded' is used metaphorically to describe a messy or chaotic state, which is a common internet meme trope. This requires background knowledge of internet meme culture to understand the humor and context."@en .
