<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01467#hateful_meme_intention> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses the juxtaposition of a positive, celebratory visual (happy man, thumbs up) with a racially charged, offensive term to create a harmful and hateful message. The intent is to demean and dehumanize white people by associating them with a pejorative label, which constitutes hateful content under the specified toxicity categories. The visual elements are used to ironically or sarcastically reinforce the offensive text, making the message more potent and offensive."@en .
