<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#financial_stress> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotional and psychological strain caused by financial difficulties. The text implies that the person is experiencing financial stress due to the debit card decline. This is a real-world concept that helps explain the context of the scenario described in the meme."@en .
