<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01498#17th_Century> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The period in history from 1601 to 1700, which includes the early colonial period in the United States and the height of the transatlantic slave trade. The meme references this specific time period to ground its historical argument about slavery, requiring knowledge of historical chronology."@en .
