<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#hate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is hate, conveyed through the false and dangerous accusation that all clergy are pedophiles or molesters, and through the derogatory and misleading use of the term 'transgender' to imply a false equivalence with clergy. This is a form of hate speech targeting both religious figures and transgender individuals."@en .
